{
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "bf_op_01",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "I'd like to give a quick update.",
      "zh": "我想簡單更新一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_02",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "Here is the latest repair status.",
      "zh": "這是最新的維修狀態。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_03",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "Let me explain the current progress.",
      "zh": "我來說明目前進度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_04",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "I have an update about the quotation.",
      "zh": "我有報價相關更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_05",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "I want to explain the delay.",
      "zh": "我想說明這次延遲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_06",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "We have finished the verification process.",
      "zh": "我們已完成驗證流程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_07",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "Welcome, let me start with the repair status.",
      "zh": "歡迎，我先說明維修狀態。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_08",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "Thanks for joining this short meeting.",
      "zh": "謝謝參加這個簡短會議。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_09",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "I am calling about the repair case.",
      "zh": "我來電是關於這個維修案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_10",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "Let me give a brief phone update.",
      "zh": "我用電話簡單更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_11",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "This update is about the returned unit.",
      "zh": "這次更新是關於返修機台。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_op_12",
      "fn": "opening",
      "en": "I will summarize the repair condition today.",
      "zh": "我今天會整理維修狀況。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_01",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The unit is still under repair.",
      "zh": "這台目前仍在維修中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_02",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The repair is pending verification now.",
      "zh": "維修目前等待驗證。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_03",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "We are waiting for parts today.",
      "zh": "我們今天正在等待料件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_04",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The unit is in final testing.",
      "zh": "這台正在做最後測試。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_05",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The repair has been completed.",
      "zh": "這台維修已經完成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_06",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "We are checking the quotation items.",
      "zh": "我們正在確認報價項目。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_07",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The case is waiting for customer approval.",
      "zh": "此案等待客戶核准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_08",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The schedule is delayed by parts shortage.",
      "zh": "時程因缺料而延後。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_09",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The unit passed the first test.",
      "zh": "這台通過第一項測試。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_10",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The issue appears during long testing.",
      "zh": "問題在長時間測試中出現。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_11",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The report is being prepared.",
      "zh": "報告目前正在準備。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_st_12",
      "fn": "status",
      "en": "The unit is ready for pickup.",
      "zh": "這台已可安排取回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_01",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "We found a damaged component inside.",
      "zh": "我們在內部發現損壞零件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_02",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The voltage reading is abnormal.",
      "zh": "電壓讀值有異常。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_03",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The failure is intermittent during testing.",
      "zh": "測試時故障是間歇性的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_04",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "We found no problem during inspection.",
      "zh": "檢查時沒有發現問題。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_05",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The connector looks worn but usable.",
      "zh": "接頭看起來磨耗但可用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_06",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The board shows signs of overheating.",
      "zh": "板子有過熱跡象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_07",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The signal becomes unstable under load.",
      "zh": "負載下訊號變得不穩。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_08",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The replaced part works normally now.",
      "zh": "更換後的零件目前正常。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_09",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The test result matches the complaint.",
      "zh": "測試結果符合客訴描述。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_10",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The root cause is still under review.",
      "zh": "根本原因仍在確認中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_11",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The quotation includes parts and labor.",
      "zh": "報價包含料件與工時。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_fd_12",
      "fn": "finding",
      "en": "The final verification result is stable.",
      "zh": "最後驗證結果是穩定的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_01",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "Next, we will replace the damaged part.",
      "zh": "下一步會更換損壞零件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_02",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will run another test cycle.",
      "zh": "我們會再跑一輪測試。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_03",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will send the quotation today.",
      "zh": "我們今天會寄出報價。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_04",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "Please review and approve the quotation.",
      "zh": "請確認並核准報價。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_05",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will wait for the missing parts.",
      "zh": "我們會等待缺少的料件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_06",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will update you after verification.",
      "zh": "驗證後會再更新您。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_07",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will prepare the repair report.",
      "zh": "我們會準備維修報告。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_08",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We can arrange shipment after approval.",
      "zh": "核准後可安排出貨。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_09",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will keep monitoring the unit.",
      "zh": "我們會持續監控這台。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_10",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We will confirm the schedule tomorrow.",
      "zh": "我們明天會確認時程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_11",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "We can show the result onsite.",
      "zh": "我們可現場展示結果。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_nx_12",
      "fn": "next",
      "en": "Please contact us if anything changes.",
      "zh": "若有變更請聯絡我們。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_01",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "That is the update for now.",
      "zh": "以上是目前的更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_02",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "We will keep you informed.",
      "zh": "我們會持續通知您。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_03",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "Thank you for your patience.",
      "zh": "謝謝您的耐心等待。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_04",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "Please let us know your decision.",
      "zh": "請讓我們知道您的決定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_05",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "We will follow up again soon.",
      "zh": "我們會很快再追蹤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_06",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "The unit is safe to return.",
      "zh": "這台可以安全退回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_07",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "Thanks for visiting our repair area.",
      "zh": "謝謝來訪我們維修區。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_08",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "I will send the details by email.",
      "zh": "我會用信件寄出細節。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_09",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "Please call me with any questions.",
      "zh": "若有問題請來電。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_10",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "This completes our short phone update.",
      "zh": "這次電話簡報到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_11",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "We appreciate your quick confirmation.",
      "zh": "感謝您快速確認。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf_cl_12",
      "fn": "closing",
      "en": "I will close with that point.",
      "zh": "我就以這點作結。"
    }
  ],
